        StaticBook("Resia OOC letter", "§bAleryn", "To Resia...\n\nI just wanted to start out by saying thank you for all the hard work and effort you have put into the group. Although I may not show it as openly as I think, I truly am grateful from the bottom of my heart.\n\nAlso I would like to thank you for the hard work you have put in towards helping the KoA.\n\nAlthough some people may not realize it, without you both groups would likely be dead. You are a much needed, and even more appreciated part of-\n\nour groups existance.\n\nSo with that said there is little I can say or do to show how much you are appreciated. As well as I will try to listen to your consul more often, including not adding my two cents on something I am wrong about.\n\nYou are a great friend Resia. I could never have chosen a better person to be my successor (IC or OOC).\n\nI look forward to working alongside you from now, until I leave, die, or quit.\n\nMay you find joy in things you do. -\n\nI will be here for you should you need someone to talk to. I will be here if you need someone to help with whatever project.\n\nThank you for everything.\n\nAleryn", ""),
        StaticBook("Homework", "§bIndra Tresery", "\"I will walk the forest with my new kin.\"\n\nMy new kin, the rest of the Druid Order. A recognition of the those within the Order becoming apart of me and myself apart of them.\n\n\"I will swim the river of truth wherever it takes me.\"\n\nI believe this just means that I promise to never withhold any truths.\n\n\nAs the trees watch over us, I shall watch over others in need.\"\n\n<The Aspects watch over us (The Order) so I pledge to do the same to thos in need.>\n\n\"I will serve nature and help restore balance, even as dusk approaches.\"\n\n<A promise to uphold the Orders duties despite how bleak the outcome may seem.>\n\n\"I vow to uphold my duties as a Dedicant of the Druidic Order.\"\n\n<Straightforward, a promise to keep loyal to their duties and the order.>", ""),
        StaticBook("Wish", "§bAlai Kharadeen", "Alai Kharadeen's Wish\nI wish for a great sum of minas. 10000 if you please. Thank you very much.", ""),
        StaticBook("A Wish", "§bKeovan Scarfen", "-------=[]=-------\n A Wish ay..\nTo be able to find a way to help friends in need for soo.. im not one fighter... A wish for a possible recipe of a potion, a teacher or medical.. anything that will help my friends stay alive\n~Keovan Scarfen\n((nanoninja23", ""),
