        StaticBook("177-1", "§bFabius Bracchus", "Imperial Voter§0\n§0§nIdentification Card          §0\n§0§lName: §0Eleana Willow§0\n§0\n§0§lYear of Birth: §01677§0\n§0\n§0§lResidency: §0Carolustadt§0\n§0\n§0177-1", ""),
        StaticBook("175-1", "§bFabius Bracchus", "Imperial Voter§0\n§0§nIdentification Card         §0\n§0\n§0§lName: §0Talia Luago§0\n§0\n§0§lYear of Birth: §01680§0\n§0\n§0§lResidency: §0Carolustadt§0\n§0\n§0175-1\n\nCome, my ser, let us prove§0\n§0While we may, the sports of love;§0\n§0Time will be ours forever;§0\n§0Why must we defer our joys?§0\n§0Fame and rumor are but toys,§0\n§0Cannot we delude the eyes\n\nOf a few poor houesehold spies?§0\n§0'Tis no sin love's fruit to steal§0\n§0But the sweet theft to reveal§0\n§0To be taken, to be seen,§0\n§0These have crimes accounted been.", ""),
