        StaticBook("Deed", "§bAldranis, Centurion of Light", "8th of The Grand Harvest, 1686\n\nI, Aldranis of Taillteann\n, vindicator of the disbanded Order of The Golden lance, hereby grant the palisade of 'The Scarlet Crusade' to one Ser Theodoric Augustus Helvets.\n\nSigned,\nThe Caretaker of 'The Scarlet Crusade'.", ""),
