        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "List of members§0\n§0The Iron Legion.§0\n§0\n§0-+: Leader :+-§0\n§0Coronius Black§0\n§0\n§0The member of longest origin within the order\n\n-++ Heavy's ++-§0\n§0These will be the ones who will head straight into battle.§0 CQC§0\n§0\n§0-\n\n-:+ Knight's +:-§0\n§0These trained in the art of swords and bows, backline mostly.§0\n§0\n§0-\n\n--+ Assassin's +--§0\n§0masters of the dagger and bow. making them the most fit for personal contracts.§0\n§0-Kor-Archery§0\n§0-Adawulf-Traps\n\nThese persons will be available for hire all over the land, prices will be set by the leader. with this person you also have to conclude the contracts and jobs.§0\n§0the amount of persons needed and what they specialize in, all the persons will be listed.", ""),
        StaticBook("Skull Pirates", "§bRobin David", "We will be back.......\n\nCaptain Skull David", ""),
        StaticBook("Elena's Note", "§bEdward Delaney", "Merry Krugsmas Edward. I hope your Krugsmas is wonderful because you deserve it. I've gathered some gifts for you, each item holds another adventure I had in your honor. I would go on countless dangerous adventures if thats what it takes for a smile on\n\nyour face. A sword, which is only a accesory for the strenth and power you have to defeat the enemies before you. A sheild to protect yourself from the awful battles you must face. The diamonds are to represent how special you are to this world, though\n\nyou are more precious than any diamond one could buy. The cookie in case you get hungry and a cog because I thought it looked neat. None of this can come close to what you have offered me, kindness. So, accept these gifts as my thanks. Love Elena", ""),
