        StaticBook("Princess of Love", "§bCatherine Windsor de Castillo", "Diary log #1: I love him but Papa might not let me have him  i want it to be M+C Forever. -Catherine\n\nHavnt seen him all Saint Dayhopefully he will show up. -Catherine\n\nSome native told me things and did things he is Paying in a way for messing with\n\na very high noble girl. -Catherine 1/17/19\n\nHe showed up i will end my log here long may my reign Catherine Princess of Love .", ""),
