        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Polar Bear:§0\n§0\n§0Yeah believe it or not polar bear's dont fuck around. These puppers can slam thier gigantic mits into someone and knock them clean the fuck over. These polar bears will latch the fuck onto thier prey and fucking mawl them\n\nlike the inconlusive peice of garbage they are. Once a bear has its sights set on someone, it'll fucking go HAM, woobling its fat hibernation girth over to pounce and slam it's gigantic belly ontop of the prey, forcing the power of it's teeth deep into\n\nwhatever victim THOUGHT they could get away from it. At the end of its life, the polar bear finds itself dying with a powerful personage, the bear wont go out without of a fight, yet when defeated will find itself honorably accepting its final fate\n\nThe nose of a polar bear has these thingys in it that make it able to smell things from FARRR far away man. Little nose thingys can really help out for doing thier magic my friend.", ""),
