        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Fire:§0\n§0\n§0Obviously it needs something flammable to thrive from, but it also needs air. It feeds off of energy and will burn through whatever it can, leaving only ash behind.§0\n§0Not only can it assist us in many different ways, but it can also destroy,\n\nwhich is why it must be contained. It's a beautiful thing really.§0\n§0\n§0Fire:§0\n§0\n§0The element of fire is an interesting one. It's beautiful really, but the closer one gets, the more unbearable it is. It can start from such a small spark, and grow to\n\nbecome something much bigger and far more ferocious.§0\n§0\n§0Electricity seems to follow the same concept, it can start with a small spark and if charged, it can become far more deadly. I did as Locke suggested and rubbed wool together, it seemed to cause some\n\nof reaction that causes sparks to form. Nothing big that could do anything significant, but still.. a reaction. I do wonder how it will feel once Locke teaches me how to cast.§0", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Task 1.§0\n§0\n§0Giver and task§0\n§0\n§0Collect flora §0\n§0\n§0~ Azalea Druid§0\n§0\n§0Priestess Quillian Caerme'onn - Serene\n\nTask 2.§0\n§0\n§0giver and task§0\n§0\n§0Lynx Druid, Tailesin§0\n§0\n§0Go into the wood to create some artistic piece and return it to her\n\nTask 3.§0\n§0\n§0giver and task§0\n§0\n§0find 10 herbs and bring them back to her§0\n§0\n§0Completed and lesson on each herb given.§0\n§0~Lillith Winterleaf\n\nTask 4.§0\n§0\n§0giver and task§0\n§0\n§0Find 15 spalings§0\n§0\n§0She did the job good! I think that this task is excellent in trying to set them into the druii community, making them meet new druids and such. Anyways, She did it! -Hecate Calithil\n\nTask 5.§0\n§0\n§0Task and giver§0\n§0\n§0befriend an animal without the use of a druid or druidic abilities§0\n§0\n§0Signed: Abelas Caerme'onn\n\nTask Six§0\n§0\n§0Giver: Caribou Druid Abelas§0\n§0\n§0Task: Befriend an animal without the use of a Druid or Druidic abilities. §0\n§0\n§0Status: Acheived§0\n§0\n§0Signed: Abelas Caerme'onn", ""),
