        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "14 of SM 1644.§0\n§0\n§0I found this book tossed in a woodpile, and I decided to start a diary. There's an odd difference between Seeing someone die in battle and seeing the results of a coward with a vendetta. While those mercs must be punished, i'm more\n\ninterested in who hired them.", ""),
