        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "-----Property------             of                      Utaria Helenson§0\n§0§w\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Cyrene-Trade Princess§0\n§0\n§0§\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Government is a Oilgarchy\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Valkeriin-Steward of Sutica§0\n§0\n§01.Need him to find house§0\n§0\n§0New to being a person\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Viltaren-Steward of Sutica§0\n§0\n§01. Gave us a plot to build on and gave Silv perms§0\n§0\n§0Relationship with Valkriin? Hawt\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Flesh Monster-Moth with no eyes\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Jan Ritter... something§0\n§0\n§01. Waldenian... duh.§0\n§0\n§02. In a relationship with Adelheid but also this Lae elf... (See Adelheid suspicion)§0\n§0\n§03. Angry boy\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0Adelheid the Suspicious§0\n§0\n§0((Litterally all the evidence Utaria has of Lae and Adelheid's smiliarities, which is a lot of at this point))§0\n§0\n§0She admited §0\n§0\n§0[!]Adelheid scratched out now is Adelheid\n\nNotes on Sutica§0\n§0\n§0((Careless whispers continues to play man this is actually a good song, and I can't live without it now))\n\nNote on Elves§0\n§0\n§0Karin'ayla: Hello in Elvish§0\n§0\n§0Aherdan: Thanks I think\n\nNotes on Everlight Hotel§0\n§0\n§0Lucian: Manager Thing§0\n§0\n§0David: Receptionist§0\n§0\n§0Weird eldritch creature is here or something", ""),
