        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "12th of Snow Maidens§0\n§01696§0\n§0\n§0Based on the events that have so far progressed, I've decided to record my thoughts here.§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n§0As of now, I have explored much of atlas. I believe I've discovered much of\n\nthe cities and capitals in addition to the land available to me to get to. I have discovered Mayan temples, Groves where Druids dwell, Peaks that sparkle jade and many more wonders. Where there is wonder there is also destruction. I have seen the ruins of\n\nHael'nor", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Gate Log;§0\n§0\n§0Kazulrah", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "19th of Sun's Smile, 1686§0\n§0\n§0A short while ago, we started working at a tavern in Belvitz, for a man named Red. Most of us were assigned as tavern guards, while Lady Alanah was given the position of barmaid. We have just recently had a trial to determine-\n\nwho will be given position as head tavern guard, between Sir Riff and some other fellow wearing lots of armour.§0\n§0I have yet to hear the results, but I am or course hoping for Sir Riff to have won.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Sorry for hitting on you while you were afk. I love you and I want to be with you.§0\n§0\n§0Love Thalion", ""),
