        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "§lRuibrium, The Leeching Crystals§0\n§0§l----------------§0Unknown among non-magi, this strange crystal leeches out, absorbing parasitically causing life to wither and fade, and eventually die.\n\nFound in deep caves as glowing red crystals, the flora and fauna around will always be greyed, if not ashes", ""),
