        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "§0           §§§0§lWarhawke§0\n§0    §0§l   Star Catalogue§0\n§0§l         §0  §0\n§0             Edition 1\n\n\n§0\n§0\n§0§o\"Passing of a great Warhawke is a celebration of rebirth; for a star is lit in the sky. And from the kindred stars our Ancestors behold our actions, and we draw wisdom from their guidance.\"\n\nConstellations illustrated in this book can be find in the night sky with naked eye. §0\n§0\n§0Niraith Ba'ikana§0\n§0Khel'seth, 1644\n\n        §0§lTomahawk§0\n§0\n§0              X§0\n§0        §0\n§0        X             §0\n§0                       X§0\n§0    X§0\n§0                  X§0\n§0   §0\n§0    X§0\n§0\n§0\n§0         X\n\n          §0§lTravois§0\n§0   X§0\n§0\n§0       X§0\n§0           §0\n§0           X         §0\n§0                       X§0\n§0               §0\n§0              X           X§0\n§0 §0\n§0                                 X§0\n§0                   X§0\n§0 §0\n§0                        X\n\n            §0§lCamp§0\n§0 §0\n§0                          X§0\n§0 §0\n§0                  X§0\n§0\n§0                §0\n§0                X§0\n§0\n§0\n§0X        X§0\n§0                   X      X§0\n\n    §0§l    Morning Sun§0\n§0\n§0        X§0\n§0\n§0                    X§0\n§0           X               X§0\n§0\n§0      X§0\n§0                                   X§0\n§0    X§0\n§0\n§0    X                             X\n\n §§§§§0§lChiefs arrowhead§0\n§0\n§0        X§0\n§0\n§0         X§0\n§0\n§0           X§0\n§0                 X§0\n§0        X§0\n§0\n§0                X§0\n§0           X§0\n§0              X\n\n      §0§l    Campfire§0\n§0\n§0                    X§0\n§0        X                    X§0\n§0\n§0X§0\n§0                   X            X§0\n§0\n§0\n§0                                 X\n\n            §0§lVolcano§0\n§0                   §0\n§0                   X§0\n§0              §0\n§0              X§0\n§0\n§0                  X§0\n§0\n§0          X              X§0\n§0\n§0    