        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Gate House Log Book. Record in format of§0\n§0\n§0[Name]§0\n§0[Date]§0\n§0[Timezone]§0\n§0[Time In]§0\n§0[Time Out]§0\n§0[Total Time]\n\nDor (BDanecker)§0\n§03/20/18§0\n§0CST§0\n§08:00 PM§0\n§010:00 PM§0\n§02 hours§0\n§0\n§0\n§0First one, you suckers better get your crap together (RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 19 - Mar 21§0\n§0EST§0\n§03 AM§0\n§05 AM§0\n§06+ hours between all days§0\n§0\n§0I'd do gate duty and occasionally check roads between League games. Give me my points!(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 22§0\n§0EST§0\n§01PM§0\n§02PM§0\n§0One hour actively watching gate.§0\n§0\n§0Just watched the gate, nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 22§0\n§0EST§0\n§05:30 PM§0\n§07 PM§0\n§0One hour on gate, one on city patrol.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened, questioned an armored human.(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 23§0\n§0EST§0\n§06 AM§0\n§08 AM§0\n§0Two hours of on and off gate duty.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened, some human visited.(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 24§0\n§0EST §0\n§012 AM§0\n§01 AM§0\n§0One hour of gate duty.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 27§0\n§0EST§0\n§06 AM§0\n§08 AM§0\n§0Patrol city, gate duty.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nDain Ireheart II§0\n§0Mar 28§0\n§0EST§0\n§012 AM§0\n§01 PM§0\n§0Patrol city.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing, at, all!(RECORDED)\n\nDor (BDanecker)§0\n§03/28/18§0\n§0CST§0\n§02:30-4:00PM§0\n§01.5 Hours§0\n§0\n§0Nothing. Dweebs are never online when I'm guarding. Scared.(RECORDED)\n\nWulf Edvin Kalbfleisch§0\n§029/3/2018§0\n§0UTC§0\n§023:00-23:22§0\n§022 Minutes§0\n§0\n§0\n§0A zombie attacked and I killed it. Nothing else happened.(RECORDED)\n\nWulf Edvin Kalbfleisch§0\n§031/3/2018§0\n§0UTC§0\n§018:50-19:51§0\n§01 hour and 1 minute§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nWulf Edvin Kalbfleisch§0\n§01/4/2018§0\n§0UTC§0\n§015:00-16:02§0\n§01 hour and 2 minutes§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nWulf Edvin Kalb