e to buy things. (RECORDED)\n\nSamuel Lythian'Valah§0\n§04/7/2018§0\n§0CST§0\n§011:07 PM to 12:30 PM.§0\n§01 hour 23 minutes.§0\n§0\n§0\n§0A few visitors came to town and an Irongut started hitting on a man. ((Recorded))\n\nWulf Edvin Kalbfleisch§0\n§09/4/2018§0\n§0UTC§0\n§014:56-15:56§0\n§01 hour§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.(RECORDED)\n\nSamuel Lythian'Valah§0\n§09/9/2018§0\n§0CST§0\n§05:20 to 6:20 PM§0\n§01 Hour§0\n§0\n§0Nothing seemed to happen really. ((RECORDED))\n\nGildrotir Brickback§0\n§04/12/2018§0\n§0EST§0\n§07:36-8:36§0\n§01 Hour§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.\n\nWulf Edvin Kalbfleisch§0\n§013/4/2018§0\n§0UTC§0\n§013:07-14:07§0\n§01 hour§0\n§0\n§0Nothing happened.\n\nEvan Lythian§0\n§0(man814)§0\n§04/14/2018§0\n§0CST§0\n§0Time in:3:00 PM§0\n§0Time out: 4:10§0\n§0One hour and 10 mins§0\n§0\n§0Nothing.\n\nGaroll Earl§0\n§0(HotMacaroon)§0\n§04/14/18§0\n§0GMT§0\n§0Time In: 10:11§0\n§0Time Out: 11:01§0\n§0Total time: 50 mins§0\n§0\n§0Nothing important, I got a potato thrown at me, which was... Interesting.\n\nOmega (joniomega)§0\n§04/15/2018§0\n§0GTM +1§0\n§0Time In: 10:21§0\n§0Time Out: 11:21§0\n§0Total Time: 1 hour§0\n§0\n§0Only one person go out. Nothing more.\n\nDevon Ireheart§0\n§015/04/2018§0\n§0EST+2§0\n§0Time In; ~6 PM§0\n§0Time Out: 8 PM§0\n§0\n§0One Resident passes in.§0\n§0\n§0Nothing else.\n\nEvan Lythian§0\n§04/15/2018§0\n§0(man814)§0\n§0CST§0\n§0Time in:6:00PM§0\n§0Time out:7:00PM§0\n§0\n§0Ummm, well besides a lot of yelling, some kids would shout mean names until I told them to fuck off", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "I will never be satisfied. \"Isn't this enough?\" They ask, saying they love me regardless, that I don't need to work, work.§0\n§0Saying that I don't need to brag that, dag, I amaze and astonish. Actions however have always and will always tell more than words.\n\nWords. What a lot I can say with my words. They tell me, and I believe, that I have skill with the quill and that I can reach my goal, my power of speech unimpeachable. But I feel like I still need to work, work. Like I need to impress them, and not only\n\nthem, but the others around me, the whole world. I will never be satisfied, for there's so much work to do and so little time. That's why I must write like I'm running out of time.\n\n\n§0\n§0     Kardryn's Quill\n\nThis one's for those who matter to me. They know.\n\nI don't have a lot of friends. But when I was a kid, my uncle Aiden once told me that, you don't need a lot of friends. As long as you have some good friends. Of course that's coming from someone with tons of friends, but what gives, it's true in my view.\n\nAnd well, what can I say? I have a very good friend, one that's helped me talk to people, one that's gotten me through rough times and one who doesn't mind me expressing myself. This sounds weird, but that friend is my quill. For in writing, I find peace.\n\nThere isn't much peace in my life- well, there is enough, though I don't feel peace. I feel like I'm running out of time constantly, like I need to hurry up for there's so much to do. So much work to do...\n\nI need to work hard, there's no other way. I need to work to achieve my goals.", ""),
