        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Book of Fire§0\n§0\n\nDesert Berry Bush, weak represents empowerment and overwhelming, found near cacti§0\n§0\n§0Flametongues root, represents heat, anger, destruction, moderate, found in forest hillsides and burned forests§0\n§0\n§0Dwarf's Pumpkin, Moderate, represents\n\nenvy, rage, bitternesss, power strength, found in swamplands next to muddy waters§0\n§0\n§0Blood Lotus, represents hope and courage, found in the entrance of caves in deserts§0\n§0\n§0Elrow Berries, represents rage, anger ,burning, moderate, found in bushes\n\nin hot climates, §0\n§0\n§0Strong§0\n§0\n§0Crimson Vase, represents heat, warmth, love, passion, and compassion, found at the base of young trees in forests§0\n§0\n§0Drake's Tail, represents heat, destruction, and chaos, found rarely in desert oasis", ""),
