        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Book of Earth§0\n\nGoblin's Ivy, weak, represents resilience, life, poison, found in desert clinging to stones/ruins/houses, looks like vine/leafs§0\n§0Saffvil, moderate, represents resilience, endurance, death, foul smelling herb found in swamp lands on dead animals/trees/\n\nplants.§0\n§0\n§0Alabaster leaf, moderate, represents immobility and perseverence, found in dryer regions of forests on trees,§0\n§0\n§0Tippens Root, moderate, represents life, regrowth, endurance, resellience, strength. Found in forests by trees.\n\nDesert Berry Bush, Moderate, represents protection and resilience, found in deserts around cacti§0\n§0\n§0Starved Coyote's Tick, represents protection, resilience, connection, found on bodies of dead animals in hot climates.§0\n§0", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Book of Water\n\nWeak§0\n§0\n§0Blissfoil, represents calmness, found under birch trees in grassy areas.§0\n§0\n§0Moderate§0\n§0\n§0Serpant's Stalk, represents life, rebirth, calmness, fluity, can be found in bodies of water in forests.", ""),
