        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Day 65 I'm still stuck in the crib where Brynaelda locked me up.. it is cold down here and so lonely. §0\n§0Day 73 My food supplies are running low i'm not sure how long i can keep going... it is harsh but my life now.§0\n§0Day 87 I'm hearing strange noises coming\n\nfrom upstairs... they are coming it must be darkness is darker then it has ever been down here.§0\n§0Day 126 I only have a drinking supply for 5 more days.. the end is coming near as is my painful death.§0\n§0Day 130 They are coming i can hear it please help my the\n\nsound it is killing my ears.. the pain .. so much pain is rushing through my veins at every pump of my exhausted hearth..§0\n§0ad§0\n§0ge§0\n§0h§0\n§0.", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "CHAPTER I§0\n§0The Debate§0\n§0\n§0For centuries upon centuries, a war of ideals and beliefs has raged within the mali culture. A constant back and forth between the Druidic and Voidal cultures has caused many acts of both violence and shame to befall both parties.\n\nIt is with these words I write today that I seek to finally put to rest this argument. A simple look into each side of the argument for both parties is what I suggest, as doing such will enlighten us all and allow us to see one another as intellectual\n\nequals in this world of constantly shifting positions and ideals.§0\n§0\n§0I hope my words today will help at least one of you. So without further delay, I give you my thoughts and observations on both sides.\n\nCHAPTER I§0\n§0The Void§0\n§0\n§0The Void is a magical plane situated in association with our own. It is used by the magi of this world to cast magical spells using the energy properties which", ""),
